# Optional. Leave unset to use the same-origin /api paths: on Vercel that is the
# Python function in api/index.py; in `npm run dev` it proxies to the engine on
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see next.config.ts). Set it only to use an engine
# hosted elsewhere, e.g. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://runmapper-api.example.com
#NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
